This template sets aarch64's userspace max-page-size to ${AARCH64_LINKER_MAX_PAGE_SIZE}

To use, add

--templates feature/aarch64-linker-max-page-size

as a setup option.

#@TYPE: Wrtemplate
#@NAME: aarch64-linker-max-page-size
#@DESCRIPTION: Set aarch64's max-page-size to ${AARCH64_LINKER_MAX_PAGE_SIZE}
